{"html":"\n  \u003cdiv class=\"page-inner flex flex-col justify-between\">\n    \u003cheader class=\"mast\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"brand\">\n        \u003cstrong>AlpacaNotes\u003c/strong>\n        \u003cspan class=\"kicker\">PART 02 · 空间拓扑与演化动力学\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"masttime font-mono text-xs\">\n        \u003cspan>PROPOSITION 2.3 · 总分主从 · PAGE 08 / 20\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/header>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"pb-2.5 border-b-2 border-ink dark:border-neutral-700\">\n      \u003ch2 class=\"ed-page-title font-serif text-[34px] font-black text-ink dark:text-white leading-tight\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"text-accent font-mono mr-3\">[2.3]\u003c/span>证明子图与双替换\n      \u003c/h2>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-baseline gap-3 pl-3.5 border-l-4 border-accent mt-2\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider shrink-0 bg-accent/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">核心论断\u003c/span>\n        \u003cp class=\"ed-thesis-text font-serif text-[21px] text-ink dark:text-neutral-200 font-semibold leading-snug\">\n          证明是因果网中的有向子图，由双向替换统摄并投射出哥德尔阴影。\n        \u003c/p>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \n    \u003cdiv class=\"ed-main ed-layout-primary grid grid-cols-12 gap-6 my-auto h-[600px] items-stretch\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-primary-left col-span-5 h-full\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"card border-t-4 bg-accent/[0.03] dark:bg-[#262626] flex flex-col justify-between p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm h-[600px]\" style=\"border-top-color:#1b4f72;\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-text-col\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-2.5 mb-3 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold tracking-wider px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded\" style=\"background:#1b4f7214; color:#1b4f72;\">§ 01\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono text-slate-400 font-semibold\">CORE MECHANISM\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[25px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white mb-3.5 leading-snug\">\n          证明的因果子图\n        \u003c/h3>\n        \u003cul class=\"space-y-3\">\n          \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">最小无环子图\u003c/strong>：证明是以公理为源、定理为汇的有向无环子图。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">因果多重同调\u003c/strong>：引理决定序列深度，多路径证明构成因果同调。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">时空路径结构\u003c/strong>：将线性文本证明还原为高维因果网中的几何轨迹。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-card-visual mt-auto pt-3 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80 flex flex-col gap-2\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-svg-box rounded-lg bg-slate-50/75 dark:bg-[#2b2b2b] p-2 border border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-700/80\">\n          \u003csvg viewBox=\"0 0 460 155\" class=\"w-full h-[145px]\" fill=\"none\">\n          \u003cpath d=\"M70 30 L170 50 M70 30 L170 110 M170 50 L280 35 M170 110 L280 120 M280 35 L390 78\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 3\"/>\n          \u003cpath d=\"M70 30 L170 50 L280 82 L390 78\" stroke=\"#2b6cb0\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"70\" cy=\"30\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#0284c7\" fill-opacity=\"0.18\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"70\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0284c7\">公理\u003c/text>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"170\" cy=\"50\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#2b6cb0\" fill-opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#2b6cb0\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"170\" cy=\"110\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#64748b\" fill-opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"280\" cy=\"82\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#d97706\" fill-opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"280\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#d97706\">中间引理\u003c/text>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"280\" cy=\"35\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#64748b\" fill-opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n          \u003ccircle cx=\"390\" cy=\"78\" r=\"15\" fill=\"#0d9488\" fill-opacity=\"0.2\" stroke=\"#0d9488\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          \u003ctext x=\"390\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0d9488\">定理\u003c/text>\n          \u003ctext x=\"230\" y=\"142\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#64748b\">蓝色实线 = Token-Event 最小无环证明子图\u003c/text>\n        \u003c/svg>\n        \u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-note-text text-[17px] leading-[1.45] text-slate-600 dark:text-neutral-300 font-sans px-1\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded mr-1.5\" style=\"background:#1b4f7216; color:#1b4f72;\">通俗类比\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan>如同在错综复杂的地铁全网中，标出从起点站到终点站的无环捷径。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-primary-right col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between gap-4 h-full\">\n        \n    \u003cdiv class=\"card ed-horiz-card border-l-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] flex items-stretch p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm flex-1\" style=\"border-left-color:#0284c7;\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-horiz-left w-[33%] pr-5 border-r border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800 flex flex-col justify-between shrink-0\">\n        \u003cdiv>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\">\n            \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded\" style=\"background:#0284c714; color:#0284c7;\">§ 02\u003c/span>\n            \u003cspan class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">COROLLARY 01\u003c/span>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[24px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white leading-snug\">\n            双向替换完备性\n          \u003c/h3>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-horiz-right w-[67%] pl-6 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n        \u003cul class=\"space-y-2.5\">\n          \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">替换与伴随替换\u003c/strong>：普通替换特化规则，伴随替换反向特化操作数。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">合一微观机制\u003c/strong>：二者统一为双向替换，完备覆盖形式蕴涵演绎。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"card ed-horiz-card border-l-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] flex items-stretch p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm flex-1\" style=\"border-left-color:#b45309;\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-horiz-left w-[33%] pr-5 border-r border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800 flex flex-col justify-between shrink-0\">\n        \u003cdiv>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\">\n            \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded\" style=\"background:#b4530914; color:#b45309;\">§ 03\u003c/span>\n            \u003cspan class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">COROLLARY 02\u003c/span>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[24px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white leading-snug\">\n            叶化与法则相对\n          \u003c/h3>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-horiz-right w-[67%] pl-6 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n        \u003cul class=\"space-y-2.5\">\n          \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">不同时间切片\u003c/strong>：假言推理或归结法仅是对同一因果网的不同叶化。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">观测参考系差异\u003c/strong>：逻辑流派的表观分歧源于认知主体参考系选择。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"card ed-horiz-card border-l-4 bg-white dark:bg-[#242424] flex items-stretch p-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200/90 dark:border-neutral-800 shadow-sm flex-1\" style=\"border-left-color:#0f766e;\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-horiz-left w-[33%] pr-5 border-r border-slate-100 dark:border-neutral-800 flex flex-col justify-between shrink-0\">\n        \u003cdiv>\n          \u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2\">\n            \u003cspan class=\"text-[12px] font-mono font-bold tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded\" style=\"background:#0f766e14; color:#0f766e;\">§ 04\u003c/span>\n            \u003cspan class=\"text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">COROLLARY 03\u003c/span>\n          \u003c/div>\n          \u003ch3 class=\"ed-card-title font-serif text-[24px] font-bold text-ink dark:text-white leading-snug\">\n            不可判定之阴影\n          \u003c/h3>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-horiz-right w-[67%] pl-6 flex flex-col justify-center\">\n        \u003cul class=\"space-y-2.5\">\n          \n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">步数缺乏上界\u003c/strong>：全量因果网搜寻路径无捷径，引理复杂度无界。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003cli class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n          \u003cspan class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent mt-2.5 shrink-0\">\u003c/span>\n          \u003cspan class=\"ed-bullet-text text-[21px] leading-[1.56] text-[#1a2233] dark:text-neutral-200 font-sans\">\n            \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-ink dark:text-white\">不完备物理起源\u003c/strong>：不可判定性本质是微观计算不可约的几何投影。\n          \u003c/span>\n        \u003c/li>\n        \u003c/ul>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"ed-bottom-bar pt-2 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-neutral-800\">\n      \n      \u003cdiv class=\"ed-takeaway-wrap flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500/10 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border-l-4 border-amber-600 rounded-r-md max-w-5xl\">\n        \u003ci class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-amber-600 text-base shrink-0\">\u003c/i>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"ed-takeaway-text text-[20px] leading-tight text-amber-950 dark:text-amber-200 font-sans\">\n          \u003cstrong class=\"font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400\">本节要旨：\u003c/strong>\u003cspan>双向替换完备统摄形式蕴涵，不可约性锚固了不可判定法则。\u003c/span>\n        \u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"folio font-mono text-xs text-slate-500 shrink-0\">\n        \u003cspan>Stephen Wolfram · The Physicalization of Metamathematics\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n  \u003c/div>\n"}